<title>EGYPT: Egyptian firm seeks 30,000 tonnes wheat bran.</title>
<headline>Egyptian firm seeks 30,000 tonnes wheat bran.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-08-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egyptian company Misr Oil and Soap announced on Saturday it wanted to buy 30,000 tonnes of wheat bran pellets, with September 11 the deadline for bids.</p>
<p>The original deadline was September 4.</p>
<p>Company officials were not available to give details.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
